================================================================================
3. WHAT THIS PROJECT DOES *NOT* COVER
================================================================================

Beyond All Reason
  Verdance's Ashes is a mutator (modinfo.lua: modtype = 1) that declares a
  dependency on Beyond All Reason and resolves it from the player's own
  installation at load time. It contains no BAR models, textures, animations,
  sounds, music or icons, and redistributes none of them.

  BAR's own content is separately licensed -- code under GPL v2, and art,
  animation, sound and music predominantly under CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0, which permits
  neither commercial use nor derivative works. Those terms are BAR's and are not
  affected, extended or reinterpreted by this file. See:
  https://github.com/beyond-all-reason/Beyond-All-Reason/blob/master/LICENSE.md

Maps
  The seven campaign maps are not distributed with this project. They are
  downloaded on demand from Beyond All Reason's own content service and remain
  the property of their respective authors under their own terms.

The Recoil engine
  GPL-2.0-or-later, and not distributed here.
  https://github.com/beyond-all-reason/RecoilEngine

Third-party reference material
  See NOTICE.


================================================================================
4. AI ASSISTANCE
================================================================================

Substantial portions of this project were written with AI assistance, reviewed
and tested by the author. This is disclosed here because at least one downstream
project this work touches -- Beyond All Reason -- requires disclosure of
AI-assisted contributions, and because it should be stated plainly regardless.

No AI-generated art, audio or video is distributed as part of the game.
